<title>INDIA: Indian castor trade closed for religious holiday.</title>
<headline>Indian castor trade closed for religious holiday.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's castor trade is shut on Monday and Tuesday for local religious festivals and will reopen on Wednesday, dealers said.</p>
<p>On Friday, castor prices fell marginally on profit-taking by traders and dealers said they expected the market to slide further. &quot;Technically the market is overbought and may attract further correction,&quot; one dealer said.</p>
<p>-- Bombay Commodities +91-22-265 9000</p>
